    "chunk_text": "5.(1) The management of the affairs of the Corporationshall be managed by a Committee of Management consistingof number of members not exceeding fifteen. It shall have aPresident, Vice President, administrative Secretary, Treasurerand such Officers and staff to perform such duties as theCorporation may determine.\n\nManagementof theactivities oftheCorporation.\n\n6Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPL 007773 Daya Sarana (G)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(3) The first Committee of Management of theCorporation shall be the Committee of Management of theFoundation holding office on the day preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act.\n\n6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation to make ruleswith regard to the matters listed below for or any of themfrom time to time, at any general meeting of the Corporationand by a majority of not less than two-thirds of the memberspresent and voting to make such rules, as are not inconsistentwith the provisions of this Act or any other written Law:\u2014\n\n(a)The election, appointment or nomination ofmembers of the Committee of Management and theirpowers and duties and terms of office;\n\n(b)The powers conduct of duties and functions ofvarious officers, agents and servants of theCorporation;\n\n(c)The procedure to be observed at the, summoningand holding of meeting of the corporation and ofthe Committee of Management, the time place,notice and agenda of such meetings, the quorumand the general conduct of such meeting;\n\n(d)Qualifications and disqualifications for themembership of the Board Management of theCorporation;\n\n(e)Administration, Management and custody of theassets of the Corporation and maintenance andauditing of its funds and accounts;\n\nRules of theCorporation.\n\n7Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(f)General administration of the Corporation andrealization of its objects.\n\n(2) Any such rule when made under subsection one (1)above, may at a like meeting and in like manner be altered,added to, amended or rescinded."
