    "chunk_text": "(f)General administration of the Corporation andrealization of its objects.\n\n(2) Any such rule when made under subsection one (1)above, may at a like meeting and in like manner be altered,added to, amended or rescinded.\n\n(4) The members of the Corporation shall be subjected tothe rules of the Corporation for the time being and suchrules when made may at a like meeting be altered, added to,amended or cancelled.\n\n7.The seal of the Corporation shall not be affixed toany instrument, except with the authority of a resolution ofthe Committee of Management and shall be authenticatedby the signature of the President and Secretary or some othertwo members as may be named for that purpose.\n\n8.All debts and liabilities of the Foundation on theday preceding the date of commencement of this Act shallbe paid to the Corporation hereby constituted and all debtsdue to and subscriptions and contributions payable to theFoundation on that day shall be paid to the Corporation forthe purpose of this Act.\n\n9.(1) The Corporation shall have its own fund and allthe sums of money granted or donated to the Corporation byany foreign or local public or private authority or individual,and all the sums of money received by the Corporation inthe carrying on of its affairs shall be credited to the fund.\n\n(2) The funds of the Corporation which are notimmediately necessary, shall be deposited in any Bank orother institution and the proceeds by way of interest on suchdeposits shall be utilized for the purposes of the Corporation.\n\nSeal of theCorporation.\n\nDebts due byand payableto theFoundation.\n\nFund of theCorporation.\n\n8Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPL 007773 Daya Sarana (G)\n\n(3) The Committee may exercise all the powers of theCorporation to borrow money and to mortgage or charge itsundertaking any property or any part thereof as security forany debt liability or obligation of the Corporation or of anythird party."
