    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nSRI LANKA ASSOCIATION FOR FISHERIES ANDAQUATIC RESOURCES (INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No.35]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon.Chathura Sandeepa Senaratne, M. P. forGampaha District on 03rd December, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on September 21, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nto incorporate the Sri Lanka Association for Fisheries andAquatic Resources\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n2\u2014PL 009504\u2014225 (12/2015)\n\n1Sri Lanka Association for Fisheries andAquatic Resources (Incorporation)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE SRI LANKA ASSOCIATION FOR FISHERIES ANDAQUATIC RESOURCES\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the \u201cSriLanka Association for Fisheries and Aquatic Resources\u201d hasheretofore been established for the promotion of effectiveinteraction and co-operation among those involved inresearch and development activities in fisheries and aquaticresources in Sri Lanka and for the purpose of effectivelycarrying out its objects according to the Constitution agreedto by its members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has applied to beincorporated in order to enable it more effectively to carryout and fulfill the several objects and purposes for which itwas established, and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application :\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Associationfor Fisheries and Aquatic Resources (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2015."
  },
