    "chunk_size_bytes": 1984,
    "chunk_text": "4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the powers to do,perform and execute all such acts, matters and thingswhatsoever as are necessary or desirable for the promotion orfurtherance of the objects of the Corporation or any one ofthem including the power to open, operate and close bankaccounts, to borrow or raise monies with or without security,to receive or collect grants and donations, to invest its funds,and to engage, employ and dismiss personnel required forthe carrying out of the objects of the Association.\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\n3Sri Lanka Association for Fisheries andAquatic Resources (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nArticles oftheConstitutionof theCorporation.\n\nPower toacquireproperty andraise money.\n\n30\n\n(2) The first Executive Committee of the Association shallbe the Executive Committee of the Corporation holdingoffice at the time of the coming into operation of this Act.\n\n6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Association, from time totime, at any Annual General Assembly and by the votes oftwo-thirds of the members present and voting, to make Articlesof the Constitution, not inconsistent with the Provisions ofthis Act, for the management of the affairs of the Associationand the accomplishment of its objects. Such Articles whenmade, at a like meeting and in like manner, be altered, addedto, amended by the Association.\n\n(2) The members of the Corporation shall be subject to theArticles of the Constitution of the Association.\n\n7.(1) The Corporation shall be able and capable in lawto acquire purchase, gift, devise, bequest, exchange or in anyother manner and to hold any movable or immovable propertyand to dispose of any such property acquired or held by theAssociation.\n\n(2) The Corporation shall have the power to borrow orraise money necessary for the furtherance of its objects andto create, execute, grant or issue any mortgages, bonds orobligations to receive such money."
