    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nSRI LANKA HIRA FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 32]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. K. Kader Masthan M. P. for Vanni Districton 02nd December, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 02, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nto incorporate the Sri Lanka Hira Foundation\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n1Sri Lanka Hira Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 009311\u2014 325 (10/2015)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI LANKA HIRA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the\u201cSri Lanka Hira Foundation\u201d has heretofore been formed10/18, Lake Drive, Colombo-08 the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Foundation according to the rulesagreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application.\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the \u201cSri Lanka HiraFoundation\u201d (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.\n\n2.From and after the commencement of this Act, suchand so many persons as now are members of the \u201cSri LankaHira Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cFoundation\u201d)or shall hereafter be admitted as members of the Corporationhereby constituted shall be a body corporate (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual succession,under the name and style of the \u201cSri Lanka Foundation\u201d andby that name may sue and be sued in all courts, with fullpower and authority to have and use a common seal andalter the same at its pleasure."
