    "chunk_size_bytes": 1966,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Roshan RanasingheJanasahana Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.\n\nIncorporationof theRoshanRanasingheJanasahanaFoundation.\n\n2Roshan Ranasinghe JanasahanaFoundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)implementing diverse programmers for thepropagation of Buddhism, Catholicism, Hinduismand Islam among the people and extending as muchsupport as possible for their promotion andestablishing societies and organizations with theparticipation of the devotees of such religiouscenters with a view to building a virtuous andpeaceful society valuing time honored customs andrituals;\n\n(b)to encourage farmers engaged in traditional andexport agricultural activities and to carry outvarious awareness programs for them;\n\n(c)providing relief and welfare services in naturaldisasters, distress and unexpected incidents;\n\n(d)to assist families of workers, farmers and such otherpersons which have become indigent due to loss ofemployment, illness, disability, death or othercause;\n\n(e)to provide or arrange to provide vocational trainingand assistance to disadvantaged young persons toengage in self-employment or to secure otheremployment;\n\n(f)to assist and actively encourage students of lower-income families or students who have lost one ormore parents or students who have faced any suchunjustice, to pursue higher education;\n\n(g)to implement programmers in relation to childhealth, adult health, disease control, clinics,exercises, sport, medical aid with a view to ensurewelfare of community;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Roshan Ranasinghe JanasahanaFoundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(h)to establish pre-schools, parks, play grounds,community centers to develop mental and physicalgrowth of children;"
  },
