    "chunk_size_bytes": 1950,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Susantha PunchinilameFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a) to work towards the promotion and furtherance of therights of women and children ;\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theSusanthaPunchinilameFoundation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n10\n\nPreamble.\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n2\u2014PL 009340 - 300 (10/2015)\n\nSusantha Punchinilame Foundation(Incorporation)2\n\n(b) to be of assistance to the victims of sudden disastersand help them to improve their living standards ;\n\n(c) to take measures to protect and preserve the moraland cultural values of people ;\n\n(d) to provide assistance in developing religiouscentres ;\n\n(e) to advise and assist all communties in the country tolive in peace and harmony ;\n\n(f) to provide co-operation and assistance includingfinancial and other aspects towards the welfare andeconomic enhancement of those women who becamewidows owing to various reasons including war, andtheir children ;\n\n(g) to provide assistance to persons with various abilitiesin the field of art, to promote and launch such sctivitiesto conduct shows and make available requiredaccessories and support all other related activities ;\n\n(h) to give physical and qualitative assistance andencouragement to schools and to enable the schoolchildren to achieve the required educationalqualification ;\n\n(i) to implement a special training programme to buildup a generation of children who appreciate valuesand good conduct on practical terms ;\n\n(j) to support and encourage the services provided bysenior citizens movements ;\n\n(k) to take action to provide self employment andnecessary support and training to the unemployedyouth community ; and\n\n10\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3Susantha Punchinilame Foundation(Incorporation)"
