    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPresented by Hon. Nalin Bandara Jayamaha, M. P. for Kurunegala Districton 01st December, 2015\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 28]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 16, 2015)\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nM. K. A. D. S. GUNAWARDANA FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the M. K. A. D. S. Gunawardana Foundation\n\n1M. K. A. D. S. Gunawardana Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2\u2014PL 006891\u2014 850 (01/2013)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE M. K. A. D. S. GUNAWARDANAFOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an Foundation called and known as the \"M. K.A. D. S. Gunawardana Foundation\" has heretofore beenformed for the purpose of effectually carrying out its objectsand matters connected with the said foundation accordingto the rules agreed to by its member:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be advantage to the public togrant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2013\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the M. K. A. D. S.Gunawardana Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013.\n\n2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many person as now are members of the\"M. K. A. D. S. Gunawardana Foundation\" (hereinafterreferred to as the \"Foundation\") or shall hereafter be admittedas members of the Corporation hereby constituted, shall bea body corporate with perpetual succession under the nameand style of the \"M. K. A. D. S. Gunawardana Foundation\"(hereinafter referred to as \"the Corporation\") and by thatname may sue and be sued with full power and authority tohave and use a common seal and to alter the same at itspleasure."
