    "chunk_text": "(h)train local and foreign missionaries from amongboth laymen and clergymen;\n\n(i)conduct professional courses for unemployed youthand find employment for them ;\n\n(j)conduct tuition classes for students preparing forexaminations;\n\n3Kandy Sri Pushpadana Society Ltd.(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(l)provide financial assistance, articles and other aidsto victims and displaced people in situations ofnatural and national disasters; and\n\n(m)act in collaboration with any general publicorganization which works for the existence ofreligion and local culture.\n\n4.(1) The Corporation comprises of a Board of Advisorsnot more than five clergymen and laymen, Board of Trusteescomprising of the Chairman, three Vice Chairman Secretaryand Treasurer, a Board of Officials comprising of Chairman,three Vice-Chairmen, Secretary, Assistant Secretary,Treasurer, Inspector, General Manager, and Secretary of thereligions division, and in addition to the Board of Officials,a General Committee comprising of fifteen officers and theGeneral Assembly.\n\nIn addition there will be four committees elected bythe General Committee at its discretion, viz. finance andbuildings, religious and cultural, education, social servicesand special projects, and sub-committees shall be appointedas may be necessary when launching respective projects.\n\n(2) As provided for by the laws and regulations andmembers of the Corporation, the administrative activities ofthe Corporation should be operated by a ManagementCouncil hereinafter referred to as the \u2018Council\u2019 comprisingof other persons elected or nominated according to theexisting regulations of the Society at the relevant time.\n\n(3) The first Management Council of the Corporationshall be the Management Council of the Society which heldoffices on the day prior to the date of commencement of theimplementation of this Act."
