    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of November 20, 2015\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 23.11.2015)\n\nJAYANTHIPURA SUBASADAKA SANGAMAYA(INCORPORATION)\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Jayanthipura Subasadaka Sangamaya\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nA\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Mrs.) Sriyani Wijewickrama M. P. forDigamadulla District\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\n1The Jayanthipura Subasadaka Sangamaya(Incorporation)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE JAYANTHIPURA SUBASADAKA SANGAMAYA\n\nWHEREAS the Sangamaya called and known as \u201cTheJayanthipura Subasadaka Sangamaya\u201d, Battaramulla, hasbeen established in the year 1969 in the District of Colombofor the purpose of effectually carrying out and transactionsall objects and matters connected with the said Sangamayaaccording to the rules agreed to by the members whoconstituted the said Sangamaya :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Sangamaya, heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich the said Sangamaya was established, and has appliedto be incorporated as \u201cThe Jayanthipura SubasadakaSangemaya Incorporated\u201d, and it will be for public interestand advantage to grant such application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as \u201cThe JayanthipuraSubasadaka Sangamaya (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015."
  },
