    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 24]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Harshana Rajakaruna M. P. for Gampaha Districton 24th November, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on Novermber 09, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5. 00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nDHAMMADEEPA FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Dhammadeepa Foundation\n\n1Dhammadeepa Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2\u2014PL 009318\u2014300 (10/2015)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE DHAMMADEEPA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as\u201cDhammadeepa Foundation\u201d has heretofore has been formedFor the purpose of effectually carrying out its objects andtransacting all matters connected with the said Foundationaccording to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has appliedto be incorporated and it will be advantageous to grant saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the DhammadeepaFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.\n\n2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cDhammadeepa Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a bodycorporate, with perpetual succession under the name andstyle of the \u201cDhammadeepa Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referredto as \u201cthe Corporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and besued, with full power and authority to have and use a commonseal and to alter the same at its pleasure.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014"
