    "chunk_text": "(a)the classification of membership, fees payable byeach class of members and admission, withdrawal,expulsion or resignation of members;\n\nTheManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\nRules of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)the election of office bearers of the Upper Councilor vacation of or removel from, office and thepowers, of the Upper Council, duties and functionsof the office bearers;\n\n(c)the appointment, powers, duties and functions andconditions of the various officers, agents andservants of the Corporation and dismissing themfrom service and terminating their services;\n\n(d)the procedure to be followed at the summoningand holding of the meeting of the Upper Council,the Corporation and any sub Council thereof,including the quorum thereof and the conduct ofthe business thereat;\n\n(e)the qualification and disqualification for themembership of the Corporation and the UpperCouncil;\n\n(f)the administration and management of the propertyof the Corporation; and\n\n(g)the general management of the Corporation for theaccomplishment of the object of the Corporation.\n\n(2) The rules of the Foundation in force on the daypreceding to the date of commencement of this Act shall, inso far as they are not inconsistent with the provisions of thisAct or other written law, be deemed to be rules of theCorporation made under this section and in like mannerrules made by the Corporation may be amended, altered,added to rescinded.\n\n(3) The members of the Corporation shall at all time besubject to the rules of the Corporation.\n\n5Dhammadeepa Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n7.All debts and liabilities of the Corporation existingon the day preceding the date of commencement of this Act,shall be paid by the Corporation hereby constituted, and alldebts due to, and subscription and contributions payable tothe Corporation on that shall be paid to the Corporatoin."
