    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nINSTITUTE OF SRI LANKA PROFESSIONALPSYCHO SOCIAL WORK (INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 21]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Piyal Nishantha De Silva, M. P. for Kalutara Districton 06th November, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 12, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nto incorporate the Institute of Sri Lanka Professional Psycho Social Work\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n1Institute of Sri Lanka Professional PsychoSocial Work (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nPreamble.\n\n2\u2014PL 009262\u2014 300 (10/2015)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE INSTITUTE OF SRI LANKAPROFESSIONAL PSYCHO SOCIAL WORK\n\nWHEREAS an Institute called and known as the \u201cInstituteof Sri Lanka Professional Psycho Social Work\u201d wasestablished in Sri Lanka by a group of dedicatedprofessionals in the field of Psycho Social Work for thepurpose of introducing and promoting professionalismamong those engaged in the said field and maintaining thehighest professional standards among the professionalpsycho social work fraternity:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute was registered underSection 5 (2) of the Voluntary Social Services Organizations(Registration & Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 as amendedby Act, No. 8 of 1998 on the Thirty First day of October TwoThousand and Seven:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute was recognized andregistered under bearing No. P20/0052 as a Training Instituteby the Tertiary and Vocational Commission of Sri Lankaunder Tertiary Education and Vocational Act, No. 20 of1990 and Government Gazette No. 887/8 dated 07. 09. 1995:"
