    "chunk_text": "(b)to introduce new psycho social strategies in areasof psycho social professional education, training,research and publication, which are necessary toimprove knowledge, skills and attitudes ofprofessional psycho social work and therebydevelop and strengthen the community;\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theInstitute ofSri LankaProfessionalPsychoSocial Work.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Institute of Sri Lanka Professional PsychoSocial Work (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(d)to until all members engaged in psycho socialmission in Sri Lanka into a single vital body capableof playing an important role in the promulgation ofprofessional and ethical standards for the practiceof professional psycho social work;\n\n(e)to foster cooperation and friendliness with themembers of the Institute and also with differentallied professions and organizations for the bestinterest of the enhancement of public social welfare;\n\n(f)to provide up to-date and relevant information topotential psycho social workers to help them makethe best informed and considered choice with regardto professional psycho social work;\n\n(g)to promote and safeguard the professional interest,rights, powers and privileges of the members;\n\n(h)to prepare and maintain a register of practitionersengage in professional psycho social work;\n\n(i)to initiate for legislation and promulgation of lawfulorders intended to increase the serviceability of thepsycho social work profession as well as safeguardand protect its inherent rights and obligations tosociety;\n\n(j)to provide members with information on careerupdates and job opportunities within and outsideSri Lanka;\n\n(k)to educate the community about what professionalpsycho social work is, and what makes it unique,and comprehensive system of Social Service;\n\n(l)to provide Members with a platform for networkingand co-ordinate events which facilitate interactionamongst Members from all over Sri Lanka andoutside Sri Lanka;"
