    "chunk_text": "(k)to educate the community about what professionalpsycho social work is, and what makes it unique,and comprehensive system of Social Service;\n\n(l)to provide Members with a platform for networkingand co-ordinate events which facilitate interactionamongst Members from all over Sri Lanka andoutside Sri Lanka;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(m)to provide opportunities and facilities for theMembers to undertake research, projects and othersuch work and to further strengthen the professionof professional psycho social work;\n\n(n)to introduce general standards of professionalconduct and practice for professional psycho socialwork and to ensure the maintenance of suchstandards in their professional activities;\n\n(o)to enter into agreements with the Government andits subsidiaries with a view to promoting all or anyof the objects of the Corporation and promotingsuch rights, privileges and concessions that isappropriate for a professional Institute;\n\n(p)to create opportunities for government andgovernment approved Non-Governmental Institutesto receive the professional and specialized servicesfrom the members of our Institute for social andcommunity development projects through psychosocial work;\n\n(q)to introduce and conduct standardized workshops,courses, seminars, projects and examinations forthose keen in professional psycho social work andto award certificates to those who reached therequired levels;\n\n(r)to introduce new social principles in all socialdevelopment projects and programmes;\n\n(s)to take any other measure that may be necessary forthe attainment of all or any of the objects of thecorporation.\n\n4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to\u2014\n\n(a)raise fund and receive grants, gifts or donations incash or kind and solicit subscriptions in Sri Lankaor abroad;\n\nGeneralpowers of theCorporation.\n\n5Institute of Sri Lanka Professional PsychoSocial Work (Incorpor