    "language": "en",
    "md5": "478ebf94a9e315f14119f52e34f6ba09",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1566,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Thidora-TheatreInstitute for Disability Oriented Research and Advocacy(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.\n\n2\u2014PL 009244\u2014300 (09/2015)\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\nIncorporationof theThidora-TheatreInstitute forDisabilityOrientedResearch andAdvocacy.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nThidora-Theatre Institute for Disability OrientedResearch and Advocacy (Incorporation)2\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to promote and enhance the creativity of thedisabled and disadvantaged in Sri Lanka and tofacilitate their integration into the Sri Lankansociety ;\n\n(b)to promote the self respect for the disabled anddesadvantage amongst the Sri Lankan society ;\n\n(c)to act against discriminations against the disabledand disadvantaged in Sri Lanka and to intervenein drafting and implementing laws for theirprotection ; and\n\n(d)to collaborate with other organizations havingsimilar objectives to those of the Corporationwhether in Sri Lanka or abroad.\n\n4. (1) The management, control and administration of theaffairs of the Corporation shall, subject to the provisions ofthis Act and of the rules of the Corporation, administered bya Board of Management consisting of such number of officebearers as may be provided for in such rules and elected inaccordance therewith.\n\n(2) The founder member of the Institution Mr. RohanaDeva Perera shall be the Chairman of the Board of Directorsfor life."
  },
