    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nMARKAS SAKAFATHUL ISLAMIYYA(INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 19]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Abdullah Mahroof, M. P. for Trincomalee Distrct on 05th November, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 12, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto incorporate the Markas Sakafathul Islamiyya\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n1Markas Sakafathul Islamiyya (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theMarkasSakafathulIslamiyya.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE MARKAS SAKAFATHUL ISLAMIYYA\n\nWHEREAS a Centre called and known as the \u201cMarkasSakafathul Islamiyya\u201d has heretofore been formed inKal-Eliya for the purpose of effectually carrying out itsobjects and transacting all matters connected with the saidFoundation according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Centre has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted several objects and matters forwhich it was established, and has applied to be incorporated,and it will be for the public advantage to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBe it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Markas SakafathulIslamiyya (Incorporation) Act, No. 2015.\n\n2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of theMarkas Sakafathul Islamiyya (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cCentre\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members of theCorporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporatewith perpetual succession under name and style of the\u201cMarkas Sakafathul Islamiyya\u201d (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued,with full power and authority to have and use a commonseal and alter the same at its pleasure."
  },
