    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of April 10, 2015\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 15. 04. 2015)\n\nIMMIGRANTS AND EMIGRANTS (AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be Published by the Minister of Public Order andChristian Religious Affairs\n\nto amend the Immigrants and Emigrants Act (Chapter 351)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 3.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause inserts a new section 35A in the Immigrants and Emigrants Act(Chapter 351) and the legal effect of the section is to make provision for the Authorityprescribed to issue or renew passports to take finger printing from an applicant for apassport or the renewal of a passport to be inserted in the passport.\n\n1Immigrants and Emigrants (Amendment)\n\n5\n\nShort title.\n\n2\u2014PL 008991\u2014450 (04/2015)\n\nL. D.\u2014O. 25/2013.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE IMMIGRANTS AND EMIGRANTSACT (CHAPTER 351)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Immigrants and Emigrants(Amendment) Act, No. of 2015.\n\n2.The Immigrants and Emigrants Act (Chapter 351) ishereby amended by the insertion, immediately after section35 thereof, of the following new section:\u2014\n\n35A. The Authority prescribed to issue orrenew passports may take finger printing forthe inclusion in the passport, from a personapplying for a passport or the renewal of apassport.\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nInsertion ofnew section35A inChapter 351.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n10\n\n\u201cTaking offingerprinting forpassportpurposes.\n\nImmigrants and Emigrants (Amendment)2"
  },
