    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 337]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. (Ven.) Athuraliye Rathana Thero, M.P.for Gampaha District on 17th March, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on March 09, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 11.00Postage : Rs. 10. 00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nINSTITUTE OF SPORT FOR PEACE, EDUCATION,EMPOWERMENT AND DEVELOPMENT(SPEED) (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Institute of Sport for Peace, Education,Empowerment and Development (SPEED)\n\n2\u2014PL 008852\u2014225 (03/2015)\n\n1 Institute of Sport for Peace, Education,Empowerment and Development (SPEED) (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 008789\u2014 325 (02/2015)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE INSTITUTE OF SPORT FOR PEACE,EDUCATION, EMPOWERMENT AND DEVELOPMENT (SPEED)\n\nWHEREAS an Institute called and known as the\u201cInstitute of Sport for Peace, Education, Empowerment andDevelopment (SPEED) \u201d has heretofore been established inSri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out itsobjects and transacting all matters connected with the saidInstitute according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Institute of Sport forPeace, Education, Empowerment and Development(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015."
  },
