    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of August 15, 2014\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 18.08.2014)\n\nLAND (RESTRICTIONS ON ALIENATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Finance and Planning\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 16.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nto make provsions to stipulate Restrictions on the Alienation of Lands inSri Lanka to foreigners, foreign companies and certain institutions withforeign shareholding; to specify the circumstances where the exemptionsare granted; to impose a Land Lease Tax for leasing of lands to foreigners,foreign companies and certain institutions with foreign shareholding;for the granting of concessions to certain development projects; forthe repeal of part vi of the Finance Act, No. 11 of 1963; and to provide formatters connected therewith or incidental thereto.\n\n1Land (Restrictions on Alienation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 23/2013.\n\nAN ACT TO MAKE PROVSIONS TO STIPULATE RESTRICTIONS ON THEALIENATION OF LANDS IN SRI LANKA TO FOREIGNERS, FOREIGN\n\nCOMPANIES AND CERTAIN INSTITUTIONS WITH FOREIGN SHAREHOLDING;\n\nTO SPECIFY THE CIRCUMSTANCES WHERE THE EXEMPTIONS ARE\n\nGRANTED; TO IMPOSE A LAND LEASE TAX FOR LEASING OF LANDS TO\n\nFOREIGNERS, FOREIGN COMPANIES AND CERTAIN INSTITUTIONS WITH\n\nFOREIGN SHAREHOLDING; FOR THE GRANTING OF CONCESSIONS TO\n\nCERTAIN DEVELOPMENT PROJECTS; FOR THE REPEAL OF PART VI OF THEFINANCE ACT, NO. 11 OF 1963; AND TO PROVIDE FOR MATTERS\n\nCONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nWHEREAS in furtherance of the development policies beingpromoted by the Government in the backdrop of a globallyintegrated environment, it is deemed expedient and necessaryto ensure the prudent use of land which is a limited resource,in a manner that preserves the national interest:"
