    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of August 01, 2014\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 04.08.2014)\n\nMUNICIPAL COUNCILS (AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Local Government andProvincial Councils\n\nto amend the Municipal Councils Ordinance (Chapter 252)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 3.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 215A of the Municipal Councils Ordinance(Chapter 252) by the repeal of the proviso to that section and the legal effect due to suchrepeal will be to revert back to the procedure followed by the Municipal Council when re-submitting a budget or supplementary budget to the Municipal Council for furtherconsideration.\n\n1Municipal Councils (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 03/2014.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MUNICIPAL COUNCILS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 252)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Municipal Councils(Amendment) Act, No. of 2014 and shall come intooperation on such date as the Minister may appoint by OrderPublished in the Gazette.\n\n2.Section 215A of the Municipal Councils Ordinance(Chapter 252) as amended by Local Authorities (SpecialProvisions) Act, No. 21 of 2012 is hereby further amendedby the repeal of the Proviso to that section.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort titleand date ofoperation.\n\nAmendmentof section215A of theMunicipalCouncilsOrdinance(Chapter252).\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nMunicipal Councils (Amendment)2"
  },
