    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the said college has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was formed and has applied to be incorporated andit will be for the public advantage to grant such application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Ridhwaniyyah ArabicCollege (Incorporation) Act, No. 2013.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to produce Islamic Theologists to lead thecommunity under the Islamic law of \u201cShariaa\u201d;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2Ridhwaniyyah Arabic College (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)to protect Islam;\n\n(c)to produce \u201cHafidhs\u201d who have learnt the HolyQuran by heart;\n\n(d)to promote and foster unity within the Islamiccommunity and find solutions of problems of suchcommunity;\n\n(e)to promote the policies of \u201cSunnath Wal Jamaath\u201dwithin the Islamic community;\n\n(f)Learning and Teaching Islam in Arabic Languageaccording to Al Quran and AL Hadhees;\n\n(g)Teaching Sinhala, Tamil, English and UrduLanguage;\n\n(h)Providing opportunity to students study Islam basedon the syllabus approved by the Ministry ofEducation and guiding the students to G.C.E.Ordinary Level and G.C.E. Advanced LevelExaminations;\n\n(i)Organizing and Conducting a separate unit for theSocial Welfare, Economic Development andEducational Improvement of Muslim Ladies;\n\n(j)to promote and foster the policies of the \u201cSunnathWal Jamaath\u201d based on holy propagation of\u201cThableekh\u201d with the \u201cFikh\u201d (concepts of theSchool of Thought) laws of the \u201cShafiee Madhhab\u201dand the belief in \u201cAl Ashariya\u201d; and\n\n(k)to do all such acts and things as are in the opinionof the Corporation connected to any of the aboveand beneficial to the growth of the College.\n\n4.(1) The management, control and administrations ofthe Corporation shall subject to the other provisions of thisAct be administered by a Board of Management consisting"
