    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 282]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Kanaka Herath, M.P. for Kegalle Districton 20th December, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on December 09, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5. 00\n\n2-2d\n\nSTUDY CENTRE FOR THE ADVANCEMENT OFTECHNOLOGY AND SOCIAL WELFARE(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate Study Centre for the Advancement of Technologyand Social Welfare (Incorporation)\n\n1Study Centre for the Advancement ofTechnology and Social Welfare (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 007780\u2014 75 (11/2013)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE STUDY CENTRE FOR THE ADVANCEMENT\n\nOF TECHNOLOGY AND SOCIAL WELFARE\n\nWHEREAS a Centre called and known as the \u201cStudyCentre for the Advancement of Technology and SocialWelfare\u201d has heretofore been formed in Sri Lanka at 75C,Dutugemunu Mawatha, Dehiwala for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Centre according to the rules agreedto by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Centre has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted several objects andmatters for which it was established, and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Study Centre for theAdvancement of Technology and Social Welfare(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013."
  },
