    "chunk_size_bytes": 1654,
    "chunk_text": "(g)to provide advices and assistance to the supply ofbasic needs of the Sri Lankans and students comingto Australia and other countries;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Study Centre for the Advancement ofTechnology and Social Welfare (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(i)to accept issues relating to the immigration,professional, social integrity, professionaleducation etc. affecting the Sri Lankans living inAustralia and other countries;\n\n(j)to organize and conduct activities for the benefit ofthe Sri Lankans and other community through printand electronic multi-media;\n\n(j)to acquire property by way of gifts, purchase, leaseand other means with the objective of establishingeducational and library facilities in the Sri Lankanstudy centre for the benefit of Sri Lankans, livingin Sri Lanka and outside;\n\n(l)to provide forum for the presentation or originalcommunications and discussions thereon;\n\n(m)to establish and maintain data repositories; and\n\n(n)to do all such other acts and things as are necessaryfor and incidental or conducive to the attainmentof the above objects.\n\n4.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject to therules in force for the time being of the Corporation, beadministered by the Board of Management elected inaccordance with the rules of the Corporation.\n\n(2) The first Board of Management of the Corporationshall consist of the members of the Board of Management ofthe Centre holding office on the day preceding the date of thecommencement of this Act.\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\n4Study Centre for the Advancement ofTechnology and Social Welfare (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
