    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 283]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. M. B. Farook M. P. for Vanni Districton 20th December, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 25, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5. 00\n\n2-2d\n\nTHE FEDERATION OF PHOTOGRAPHIC SOCIETIESOF SRI LANKA (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Federation of Photographic Societies of Sri Lanka\n\n1The Federation of Photographic Societiesof Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2\u2014PL 007730\u201475 (11/2013)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE FEDERATION OF PHOTOGRAPHICSOCIETIES OF SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS a Federation called and known as the \u201cTheFederation of Photographic Societies of Sri Lanka\u201d hasheretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Federation according to the rulesagreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Federation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the The Federation ofPhotographic Societies of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2013."
  },
