    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the said research Institute has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted objects and mattersfor which it was established, with regional and internationalacclaim and has applied to be incorporated, and it will be forthe public advantage to grant the application :\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n2.From and after date of commencement of this Act, suchand so many persons as presently are members of the Institutefor Research and Development (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cInstitute\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members of theCorporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate,\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\nIncorporationof theInstitute forResearch &DevelopmentSri Lanka.\n\n25\n\n30\n\n2Institute for Research and Development, Sri Lanka(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetualsuccession, under the name and style of the \u201cInstitute forResearch and Development\u201d and by that name may sue and besued and all Courts with full power and authority to have anduse a common seal and to alter same at its pleasure.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be :\u2014\n\n(a) to establish and institute of Research andDevelopment non-profit making research academy ;\n\n(b) to promote and assist the advancement of academicresearch by development, training, education andextension ;\n\n(c) to observe, promote and safe-guard higher ethicalstandards as an essential component of reseacrh,through development, training, education, extensionand protect the rights of the research participantsthrough ethic review procedures ;"
